[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12961.229, "timestamp": "03:36:01", "text": "呃，如果我能得到足够的，我可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12963.83, "timestamp": "03:36:03", "text": "在获得足够的数量或制作完成后，还有剩余。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12967.83, "timestamp": "03:36:07", "text": "足够支付索具费用了，我可以攒钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12971.51, "timestamp": "03:36:11", "text": "或者像我那样利用多余的钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12974.309, "timestamp": "03:36:14", "text": "感谢大家的支持，让我们得以资助首秀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12976.87, "timestamp": "03:36:16", "text": "因为我说，“不，我一直在直播。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12979.83, "timestamp": "03:36:19", "text": "我想大概是四年或五年吧。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12983.03, "timestamp": "03:36:23", "text": "从未正式发布过。我一个也没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12986.71, "timestamp": "03:36:26", "text": "以我的名义首次亮相。是的，很遗憾，事实的确如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12989.19, "timestamp": "03:36:29", "text": "这是事实。我目前还未正式出道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12996.83, "timestamp": "03:36:36", "text": "知道。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12999.91, "timestamp": "03:36:39", "text": "嗯，我以为我……不，不，我不会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13003.67, "timestamp": "03:36:43", "text": "停止直播。不。嗯，是的，白色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13005.51, "timestamp": "03:36:45", "text": "背景和黑色的东西或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13008.79, "timestamp": "03:36:48", "text": "某物。可能会出现呃呃呃的混乱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13012.15, "timestamp": "03:36:52", "text": "无论我是否毕业，我都明白。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13015.19, "timestamp": "03:36:55", "text": "它不是。我之前说过一次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13018.469, "timestamp": "03:36:58", "text": "我会说，要经常重复这句话。"}]